<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-INJURED GRAF PULLS OUT OF HANOVER EVENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-INJURED GRAF PULLS OUT OF HANOVER EVENT.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Germany 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steffi Graf has pulled out of next week's women's tennis tournament on her home soil in Hanover because of a nagging knee injury, organisers said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The world number one has been out of action since she hurt her left knee at the start of the month and was forced to pull out of the final of the Pan Pacific event in Tokyo.</p>
